<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
    <title>Quota Exceeded (402) | Formbox</title>
    <!-- PicoCSS v2 Pumpkin Theme -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/pico.pumpkin.min.css"/>
</head>
<body>

    <main class="container" style="max-width: 600px; padding-top: 5rem; padding-bottom: 5rem; text-align: center;">
        <article style="padding: 3rem 2rem;">
            <header style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                <mark style="font-size: 2.5rem; display: inline-block; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 50%;">💳 402</mark>
                <h1 style="margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Submission Quota Exhausted</h1>
                <p>This form endpoint has reached its monthly submission quota limit.</p>
            </header>

            <p style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                The form owner needs to upgrade their plan to accept additional submissions.
            </p>

            <footer>
                <small><a href="/static">Powered by <strong>Formbox</strong></a> — Cloudflare Edge Form Backend</small>
            </footer>
        </article>
    </main>

</body>
</html>